{"4258440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Offroad Arcade", "steam_appid": 4258440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Offroad Arcade</strong> is a fast-paced arcade offroad racing game inspired by classic racers, built with modern features and tight controls in mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race across <strong>20 tracks</strong> spread over <strong>four distinct biomes</strong> — desert, savanna, forest, and snow — each with its own visual style and driving feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose how you play:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race</strong> – compete for position and master each track</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Trial</strong> – perfect your driving and chase the best times</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Roam</strong> – explore tracks freely and enjoy the terrain</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new content through progression as you improve your skills and complete challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>toggleable retro pixel effect</strong> lets you switch between clean modern visuals and a nostalgic pixel-styled look at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed as a <strong>solo developer project</strong>, Offroad Arcade focuses on pure gameplay, performance, and responsiveness — with <strong>full controller support</strong> and optional <strong>FSR upscaling</strong> for smoother performance on a wide range of systems.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏁 <strong>Arcade-style offroad racing</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗺️ <strong>20  tracks</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 <strong>4 biomes</strong>: Desert, Savanna, Forest, Snow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>3 game modes</strong>: Race, Time Trial, Free Roam<